revision 2a3a3ddfbfc3d8e98c1070680b2fa98df88c3452.
https://huggingface.co/tc-mb/MiniCPM-V-Apps-gguf

voice-language.gguf is the unchanged VoxCPM2-BaseLM-Q4_K_M.gguf.
voice-acoustic.gguf was modified by QnVoice from the upstream F16
acoustic GGUF. QnVoice quantized eligible transformer matrices in
ResidualLM, LocEnc, and LocDiT to Q8_0. The vocoder and stop predictor
retain the source precision.

voice-reference.wav is an original synthetic audio reference created
for QnVoice using mlx-community/VoxCPM2-4bit, revision
dc9e5c187858da5f4a13dc4c247e297339216381.
